-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Gather Motion 3:1  (slice1; segments: 3)
   ->  Seq Scan on empty_agg_matched o
         SubPlan 1
           ->  Aggregate
                 ->  Result
                       Filter: (i.a = o.d)
                       ->  Materialize
                             ->  Broadcast Motion 3:3  (slice2; segments: 3)
                                   ->  Seq Scan on empty_agg_inner i
 Optimizer: GPORCA
